<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">L.&nbsp;The Company shall have
prepared a Current Report on Form 6-K with respect to the Placement, including as an exhibit thereto this Agreement.</P>

